Z||000009||Songman||08-27-2001||10:37 PM||||If he wants an 87 Monte Carlo with a 350 he'll have to put it in there. All Monte Carlo SS's from 83-88 were 305HO's from the factory...<P>The VIN is 1G1GZ11G9HP147967...<P>I had someone here on the forum run it for me last year. It is clean but by all means have him run it. Ain't Carfax a great thing!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
